    "updated_at": "2022-03-31T21:52:03Z",
    "body": "As @tabatkins said, MathML exists already, and can represent exponents as both Presentation MathML and Content MathML. So closing this.\r\n\r\nHow copy/paste transforms HTML to plain text isn't specified as far as I know (though [innerText](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#the-innertext-idl-attribute) is similar).",
